<div class="w-full pt-4">
<svg class="w-full h-8 text-primary overflow-visible" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewbox="0 0 240 32">
<path d="M0,28 L30,24 L60,22 L90,16 L120,18 L150,11 L180,9 L210,5 L240,2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
<circle class="fill-primary" cx="240" cy="2" r="3" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5"></circle>
</svg>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Metric 2 -->
<div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col justify-between gap-4">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-secondary">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold">Respon Tanggap Darurat</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">timer</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-display text-display text-on-surface font-bold tracking-tight">&lt; 15 <span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary">Menit</span></span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary mt-1">Rata-rata waktu koordinasi pertama sejak pesan/panggilan darurat keluarga nasabah diterima.</span>
</div>
<div class="w-full bg-surface-container-highest rounded-full h-2 overflow-hidden mt-6">
<div class="bg-primary h-full rounded-full" style="width: 94%;"></div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Metric 3 -->
<div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col justify-between gap-4">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-secondary">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold">Tingkat Kepuasan Klaim</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">sentiment_very_satisfied</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-display text-display text-on-surface font-bold tracking-tight">99.4 <span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary">%</span></span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary mt-1">NPS (Net Promoter Score) penanganan klaim cashless tanpa sengketa administratif berkepanjangan.</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-primary pt-6 font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span>
<span class="text-secondary ml-2 font-medium">Berdasarkan audit internal 2023–2024</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- SECTION 2: 4-STEP CONCIERGE CLAIM BLUEPRINT -->
<section class="w-full px-6 lg:px-12 py-16 bg-surface-container-lowest">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-12">
<!-- Section Intro -->
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-xl">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Prosedur Pendampingan Terstruktur</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Alur 4 Langkah: Tenang Tanpa Beban Finansial</h2>
</div>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary max-w-md">
          Protokol berstandar industri yang dirancang agar keluarga fokus sepenuhnya pada penyembuhan pasien, sementara teknis birokrasi asuransi kami tangani.
        </p>
</div>
<!-- 4 Step Cards Asymmetrical Grid -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
<!-- Step 1 -->
<div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface-container flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary font-headline-sm text-headline-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">1</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-2xl">ring_volume</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Notifikasi Darurat 24/7</h3>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary uppercase font-semibold">Sebelum / Saat Masuk RS</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Hubungi Denny Indra langsung begitu dokter merekomendasikan rawat inap. Denny menyiapkan data kepesertaan polis, nomor kartu virtual PRUPrime, dan surat rujukan awal.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-base">check_circle</span>
<span>Aktivasi Jaminan Awal Segera</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Step 2 -->
<div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-surface-container flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary font-headline-sm text-headline-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">2</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-2xl">local_hospital</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Koordinasi RS Rekanan</h3>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary uppercase font-semibold">Administrasi Cashless</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Tim berkoordinasi langsung dengan Admission &amp; TPA Rumah Sakit (lokal maupun internasional seperti Singapura &amp; Malaysia) untuk memastikan fasilitas rawat kamar kelas VIP/VVIP siap sedia.
            </p>
</div>
