</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Pemantauan Surat Jaminan Akhir (Final Guarantee Letter) diterbitkan hingga 100% tagihan yang eligible tertutup lunas. Klien pulang dengan tenang dan menerima rekapitulasi klaim resmi.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-base">check_circle</span>
<span>Rekapitulasi Portofolio Rapi</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- SECTION 3: VERIFIED CASE STUDIES & EXECUTIVE TESTIMONIALS -->
<section class="w-full px-6 lg:px-12 py-16">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-14">
